  [Code.FieldLayout]: {
    text: "field '{word}' of '{first}' is '{second}', and '{other}' declares it as '{place}'; a class can narrow a field of the class it extends only to objects of a type down the chain of its type, such as 'Dog' for 'Animal', which lie in memory as they do",
