  [Code.PredicateUnproven]: {
    text: "{word} says '{first}', but this may give true while '{other}' is only known to be '{second}'; show it with what narrows types: a union's tag, 'typeof', 'instanceof', '!= undefined', 'Array.isArray' or a function that tests it (checks of fields alone do not make an object of a type)",
