  [Code.UnknownOrAssign]: {
    text: "'||=' cannot test an unknown value: it may hold 0, \"\" or false, which would count as false; give a default with '??=': '{word} ??= {other}'",
  },
  [Code.ArrayOrAssign]: {
    text: "an array is always truthy, even when empty, so '||=' never assigns; check its length: 'if ({word}.length == 0) {word} = {other}'",
